# Committed durable browser evidence lives under artifacts/browser-* and
# artifacts/playtest-* (committed intentionally as illustrative evidence; the
# authoritative evidence tier still requires a hosted fixture — see docs).
# Ephemeral local authority/test output:
artifacts/tmp/
artifacts/attack-loop/
# Stray root-level debug screenshots (not durable evidence)
artifacts/*-debug.png
# Isolated browser-test harness build output (generated, never committed)
.next-isolated-*/
cloudflare/.dev.vars

# Local agent/runtime state (rebuildable; never commit databases, sessions,
# browser installations, or tool hook state).
.mimosa/
cloudflare/.mimosa/
.wrangler-play-state/
artifacts/play-session/
# Durable polish receipts may contain a local authority runtime subtree; keep
# its rebuildable Miniflare databases and traces out of Git.
artifacts/polish-2026-09-05/authority/
